{"title":"Career Roadmap · Hydrographic Surveyor","role":"Hydrographic Surveyor","summary":"A Hydrographic Surveyor measures and maps the physical characteristics of oceans, seas, rivers, lakes, ports and other water bodies.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Ocean Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Hydrographic Surveyor measures and maps the physical characteristics of oceans, seas, rivers, lakes, ports and other water bodies."},{"type":"p","text":"The role focuses on accurately determining:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Water depths"},{"text":"Seabed/topographic elevation"},{"text":"Shorelines"},{"text":"Seabed features"},{"text":"Navigation hazards"},{"text":"Underwater structures"},{"text":"Tidal levels"},{"text":"Currents"},{"text":"Sediment and seabed characteristics"},{"text":"Coastal morphology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Hydrographic surveying supports:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nautical charting"},{"text":"Port construction"},{"text":"Dredging"},{"text":"Offshore wind"},{"text":"Subsea cables"},{"text":"Pipeline installation"},{"text":"Coastal engineering"},{"text":"Marine construction"},{"text":"Navigation safety"},{"text":"Environmental monitoring"},{"text":"Offshore infrastructure"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong Hydrographic Surveyor combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hydrography","Oceanography","Geodesy","GNSS","Bathymetry","Sonar","Surveying","GIS","Data Processing","Marine Operations"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech/B.E. Ocean Engineering"},{"text":"Surveying, hydrography, oceanography, GNSS, sonar and GIS"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Junior Hydrographic Surveyor / Survey Engineer"},{"text":"Field surveys, bathymetry, positionin