ater depth."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Single-beam echo sounder"},{"text":"Multibeam echo sounder"},{"text":"Swath bathymetry"},{"text":"Sound velocity"},{"text":"Beam geometry"},{"text":"Bottom detection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Single-Beam Echo Sounder"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Transducer","Acoustic Pulse","Seabed","Echo","Travel Time","Water Depth"]},{"type":"p","text":"Basic principle:"},{"type":"p","text":"\\[ Depth \\approx \\frac{c\\,t}{2} \\]"},{"type":"p","text":"where:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"\\(c\\) = sound speed in water"},{"text":"\\(t\\) = two-way travel time"},{"text":"The actual survey solution requires corrections for vessel motion, sound speed, draft, timing and reference datum."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Multibeam Echo Sounder"},{"type":"p","text":"MBES is one of the most important technologies for modern hydrography."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transmit array"},{"text":"Receive array"},{"text":"Beamforming"},{"text":"Swath"},{"text":"Beam angles"},{"text":"Backscatter"},{"text":"Bottom detection"},{"text":"Point clouds"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Concept:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Survey Vessel","Multibeam Sonar"]},{"type":"p","text":"↙ ↓ ↘"},{"type":"flow","items":["Seabed Swath","Thousands of Soundings","Bathymetric Surface"]},{"type":"h","text":"Multibeam Corrections"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the importance of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vessel position"},{"text":"Roll"},{"text":"Pitch"},{"text":"Heading"},{"text":"Heave"},{"text":"Draft"},{"text":"Sound velocity"},{"text":"Timing"},{"text":"Transducer alignment"},{"text":"Calibration"},{"text":"Incorrect motion or sound-velocity data can create significant bathymetric errors."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sound Velocity"},{"type":"p","text":"Sound speed in water depends mainly on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Salinity"},{"text":"Pressure/de